WINDS\n\n![5th Anniversary of the April 27, 2011 Tornado 
Outbreak](https://www.al.com/resizer/v2/PREZ2F5NLJAFJBFQYPQ7AXVWQE.jpg?auth=3719a3d8ea5671d963144e5743a6fa9fb0bede826844
3dc4f1079fa993b4c4cd&width=1280&smart=true&quality=90)\n\nTotal devastation on South Clay Street in Hackleburg a couple 
