office in [Smithville, Mississippi](/wiki/Smithville,_Mississippi \"Smithville, Mississippi\") after [an EF5 tornado hit
the town](/wiki/2011_Smithville_tornado \"2011 Smithville tornado\"), an aerial view of EF5-rated tornado damage in 
