significant Alabama tornadoes in a tabular format that includes time, affected counties, EF rating, path length, maximum
width, and casualty statistics.[9] This official record aligns with the Alabama Tornado Database for 2011 in identifying
the Sawyerville–Eoline tornado as an EF3 event with a long track across three counties, seven fatalities, and fifty 
